OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged after no verdict
OL,4,Ain murder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been discharged after
OL,7,Ffailing to reach a verdict in the trial
OL,8,Fof a man accused of murder.
OL,10,FGraham Howard, 49, of Brook Street in
OL,11,FSyston, Leicestershire, denies killing
OL,12,FSimon Geary between 22 and 23 December
OL,13,F2025.
OL,15,FOn Wednesday, Judge Timothy Spencer KC
OL,16,Fdischarged jurors at Leicester Crown
OL,17,FCourt after they had deliberated for
OL,18,Fmore than 23 hours.
OL,20,FA retrial - which is expected to last
OL,21,Fthree weeks - has been listed for 14
OL,22,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
